Real coefficients for the element routines in this addon.

-----------------------------------
1   C1 for the Mooney-Rivlin model 
    Note: set C1=G/2 for the special case of the neo-Hookean model. Here G is
    the modulus.

2   C2 for the Mooney-Rivlin model 
    Notes:
     - set C2=0 for the special case of the neo-Hookean model.
     - If model=coefficients%i(3) set to 1 terms with C2 are not even computed
       and coefficients%i(2) is not used.

3-50 reserved for future use
